{%- comment -%}
  Free Calm Spray gift on the Buy 3 box of the BOGO test template (not the senior template).
  Renders the blush gift strip docked under the box.
  value: the struck-through value shown in the strip, e.g. $45 (the live Calm Spray price).
  The Calm Spray itself is added to the cart by the Buy Now script and made free at checkout by an automatic Buy X Get Y discount.
{%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="obs__gift">
    <img class="obs__gift-img" src="{{ 'rejuvia-calm-bottle.png' | asset_url }}" width="33" height="240" alt="Calm Spray" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <span class="obs__gift-txt">
      <span class="obs__gift-title">+ FREE Extra Gift: Calm Spray</span>
      <span class="obs__gift-sub">Added to your order automatically</span>
    </span>
    <span class="obs__gift-price">{%- if value != blank -%}<s>{{ value }}</s>{%- endif -%}<span>FREE</span></span>
  </span>
